1. Restore **`src/livox_ros_driver2/launch_ROS2/rviz_MID360_launch.py`** to the pre-refactor version (hardcoded module params; no per-arg `DeclareLaunchArgument` except `lvx_file_path` if that was the old behavior).
2. In **`launch_slam.launch.py`**: remove **`_resolve_slam_bringup_overlay_path`**, **`_load_slam_bringup_config`**, **`_livox_launch_arg_pairs`**; re-insert **`USER_LAUNCH_CONFIG`**: translate **`slam_bringup.yaml`** (YAML) → Python dict literals; set **`U = USER_LAUNCH_CONFIG`**; remove **`bringup_config`** `DeclareLaunchArgument`; remove Livox **`launch_arguments=`** on **`IncludeLaunchDescription`**.
3. Remove **`src/ros_project_bringup/config/slam_bringup.yaml`**; remove the **`config/*.yaml`** line from **`setup.py`** if you do not want the directory installed.
4. Revert the one-line edits in **`ekf_python.yaml`**, **`ekf_node.py`**, and the markdown files if you want old wording.
5. Run `colcon build --packages-select ros_project_bringup livox_ros_driver2` (or full workspace) after revert.

